{"url": "（本地文件）004、第四节：时态入门，实现从静态描述到动态表达的跨越.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\004、第四节：时态入门，实现从静态描述到动态表达的跨越.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 11.19, "text": "前面的三节课,我们走了一遍大部分的英语代词,", "end": 17.06}, {"start": 17.06, "text": "对指定事物跟阐述或者描述事物的所属已经有了比较清楚的完整的概念。", "end": 26.1}, {"start": 26.1, "text": "今天我们将把人的动作和互动带入到这些代词中,这些语言中,", "end": 34.98}, {"start": 34.98, "text": "让各个主体互动起来。", "end": 38.9}, {"start": 38.9, "text": "这是你们踏向说完整英语句子的关键的一节课。", "end": 44.87}, {"start": 44.87, "text": "在这节之后,你就能基本的阐述你自己或者不同主体之间的互动关系和指代关系以及从属关系。", "end": 57.32}, {"start": 57.32, "text": "你能让这个世界动起来。", "end": 60.32}, {"start": 60.32, "text": "After today's lesson, things will start moving.", "end": 65.73}, {"start": 65.73, "text": "Here we go。", "end": 66.53}, {"start": 66.53, "text": "首先我们建立这个情境,这个男人帽子在桌上,这个话要怎么说?", "end": 73.85}, {"start": 73.85, "text": "This is a man. His hat is on the table.", "end": 81.1}, {"start": 81.1, "text": "这是我们已经熟悉的概念了。", "end": 83.3}, {"start": 83.3, "text": "好啦,现在破天荒的第一次,他要去跟物体进行互动了。", "end": 89.9}, {"start": 89.9, "text": "帽子是死的,人是活的,所以他要去拿。", "end": 94.16}, {"start": 94.16, "text": "He will take,注意我的手,take.", "end": 101.04}, {"start": 101.04, "text": "He will take the hat from the table, off the table.", "end": 106.44}, {"start": 106.44, "text": "He will take the hat off the table.", "end": 113.45}, {"start": 113.45, "text": "我们上一课说in, on, off, on, off.", "end": 124.17}, {"start": 124.17, "text": "我们平时开关灯也是on, off, right?", "end": 128.26}, {"start": 128.26, "text": "on, off.", "end": 131.36}, {"start": 131.36, "text": "He will take the hat off the table.", "end": 138.54}, {"start": 138.54, "text": "这里是不是注意到一个新的词,will。", "end": 142.0}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "Will是打算去拿,已经拿了,还是过去拿了。", "end": 149.46}, {"start": 149.46, "text": "过去时,现在时和未来时,终于要在这个单元里出现了。", "end": 159.7}, {"start": 159.7, "text": "注意这个图,他还没有拿到帽子。", "end": 162.7}, {"start": 162.7, "text": "他有这个意愿,意愿用英语怎么说?", "end": 167.42}, {"start": 167.42, "text": "Will, I will teach you lesson four.", "end": 174.56}, {"start": 174.56, "text": "我将要教你们,我意愿教你们。", "end": 179.03}, {"start": 179.03, "text": "He will take the hat off the table.", "end": 184.06}, {"start": 184.06, "text": "他还没成功做这件事。", "end": 186.26}, {"start": 186.26, "text": "目前是未来时,未来时英语就是will。", "end": 191.66}, {"start": 191.66, "text": "He will take this hat off the table.", "end": 194.86}, {"start": 194.86, "text": "He,这时候他已经拿住帽子了。", "end": 199.94}, {"start": 199.94, "text": "He is taking the hat.", "end": 202.3}, {"start": 202.3, "text": "这时候已经不是will take了。", "end": 205.1}, {"start": 205.1, "text": "这时候是正在拿着,taking。", "end": 208.7}, {"start": 208.7, "text": "注意这是一个持续的动作。", "end": 211.7}, {"start": 211.7, "text": "我们描述一个现在的东西的时候,往往是进行中的。", "end": 216.1}, {"start": 216.1, "text": "进行中就会有一个in的声音。", "end": 219.3}, {"start": 219.3, "text": "Taking like this.", "end": 222.1}, {"start": 222.1, "text": "I will take the hat off the table.", "end": 225.76}, {"start": 225.76, "text": "I am taking the hat off the table.", "end": 231.93}, {"start": 231.93, "text": "注意到差别了吗?", "end": 233.66}, {"start": 233.66, "text": "这就是英语的现在时。", "end": 235.66}, {"start": 235.66, "text": "这个显然是现在时。", "end": 237.46}, {"start": 237.46, "text": "He is taking it off the table.", "end": 239.86}, {"start": 239.86, "text": "这里不说the hat,这里说it.", "end": 246.27}, {"start": 246.27, "text": "He is taking it off the table.", "end": 253.02}, {"start": 253.02, "text": "这个就是进行中的时态。", "end": 255.02}, {"start": 255.02, "text": "我们一般叫现代进行时。", "end": 257.62}, {"start": 257.62, "text": "He took it off the table.", "end": 259.62}, {"start": 259.62, "text": "这时候帽子已经拿完了,他已经拿走了。", "end": 264.4}, {"start": 264.4, "text": "He took it off the table.", "end": 266.6}, {"start": 266.6, "text": "帽子早已离开了桌面。", "end": 269.0}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "帽子在桌面这个状态已经成了过去。", "end": 272.8}, {"start": 272.8, "text": "所以这里不再说take了,而是说take的过去是took。", "end": 278.32}, {"start": 278.32, "text": "你们看我连贯的做一遍。", "end": 281.98}, {"start": 281.98, "text": "I will take the hat off the table.", "end": 288.83}, {"start": 288.83, "text": "我打算做这个事。", "end": 291.32}, {"start": 291.32, "text": "I am taking the hat off the table.", "end": 296.66}, {"start": 296.66, "text": "I took the hat off the table.", "end": 300.46}, {"start": 300.46, "text": "注意最后这个took the hat。", "end": 303.46}, {"start": 303.46, "text": "说明take the hat off the table这件事情已经过去了。", "end": 308.46}, {"start": 308.46, "text": "I'm walking away,我正走着离开。", "end": 314.06}, {"start": 314.06, "text": "He took it off the table.", "end": 316.26}, {"start": 316.26, "text": "这是已经过去了,是个完成的状态。", "end": 320.52}, {"start": 320.52, "text": "这个就是基础的过去式。", "end": 323.52}, {"start": 323.52, "text": "所以英语最基本三个时态。", "end": 325.72}, {"start": 325.72, "text": "我们结合我们已经学过的英语做了一次复合的呈现。", "end": 330.32}, {"start": 330.32, "text": "好,现在男人已经把帽子拿出门了。", "end": 334.12}, {"start": 334.12, "text": "当然任何男人拿帽子出门,目的肯定是要戴。", "end": 339.65}, {"start": 339.65, "text": "He will put this hat on his head.", "end": 344.02}, {"start": 344.02, "text": "He will put the hat on his head.", "end": 358.17}, {"start": 358.17, "text": "He will put it on his head.", "end": 365.48}, {"start": 365.48, "text": "He will put his hat on his head.", "end": 368.08}, {"start": 368.08, "text": "进行中是不是有个硬的声音。", "end": 371.88}, {"start": 371.88, "text": "He is putting his hat on his head.", "end": 378.66}, {"start": 380.02, "text": "He is putting his hat on his head.", "end": 383.62}, {"start": 383.62, "text": "是不是特别直观。", "end": 385.42}, {"start": 385.42, "text": "He will put the hat on his head.", "end": 389.02}, {"start": 389.02, "text": "He is putting the hat on his head.", "end": 392.02}, {"start": 392.02, "text": "这是完成后要怎么说。", "end": 394.02}, {"start": 394.02, "text": "He put his hat on his head.", "end": 396.66}, {"start": 396.66, "text": "He put his hat on his head.", "end": 399.06}, {"start": 399.06, "text": "It is on his head.", "end": 400.66}, {"start": 400.66, "text": "He put it on.", "end": 401.66}, {"start": 401.66, "text": "注意put这个词现在进行是putting。", "end": 408.22}, {"start": 408.22, "text": "未来打算will put,过去也是put。", "end": 413.02}, {"start": 413.02, "text": "有人就说了,过去的词不是有个的声音吗。", "end": 417.22}, {"start": 417.22, "text": "大部分英语词适用于什么。", "end": 419.02}, {"start": 419.02, "text": "过去是有个的声音。", "end": 420.82}, {"start": 420.82, "text": "就像现在是一个硬的声音。", "end": 423.22}, {"start": 423.22, "text": "但是因为put的原本的声音就很像putted。", "end": 427.62}, {"start": 427.62, "text": "所以他就没有这个延伸。", "end": 429.42}, {"start": 429.42, "text": "他直接以常态作为过去式。", "end": 433.02}, {"start": 433.02, "text": "你们不要去实际这个。", "end": 434.82}, {"start": 434.82, "text": "用多了就会了。", "end": 436.42}, {"start": 436.42, "text": "何况这里的重点也不是put这个动作。", "end": 439.82}, {"start": 439.82, "text": "而是时态和代词。", "end": 442.02}, {"start": 442.02, "text": "不要去急这个。", "end": 444.44}, {"start": 444.44, "text": "He put his hat on his head。", "end": 446.24}, {"start": 446.24, "text": "这里put是过去式。", "end": 448.04}, {"start": 448.04, "text": "我提醒你们一下。", "end": 450.67}, {"start": 450.67, "text": "就像刚刚的take took。", "end": 453.27}, {"start": 453.27, "text": "他已经是一个过去状态了。", "end": 456.14}, {"start": 456.14, "text": "He put his hat on his head.", "end": 457.94}, {"start": 457.94, "text": "The hat, he put it on.", "end": 460.54}, {"start": 460.54, "text": "The hat is on his head.", "end": 462.34}, {"start": 462.34, "text": "It was on the table.", "end": 465.32}, {"start": 465.32, "text": "这里帽子已经不在桌上了。", "end": 467.52}, {"start": 467.52, "text": "我在描述以前帽子的状态的时候。", "end": 470.12}, {"start": 470.12, "text": "我就不说it is on the table。", "end": 472.52}, {"start": 472.52, "text": "因为如果我说it is on the table。", "end": 475.52}, {"start": 475.52, "text": "说明帽子还在桌上。", "end": 477.52}, {"start": 477.52, "text": "所以为了做区分。", "end": 478.92}, {"start": 478.92, "text": "老外就有一个is的过去状态。", "end": 481.52}, {"start": 481.52, "text": "就是was.", "end": 483.12}, {"start": 483.12, "text": "It was on the table.", "end": 485.58}, {"start": 485.58, "text": "But now it's not.", "end": 486.78}, {"start": 486.78, "text": "他现在不在桌上了。", "end": 488.18}, {"start": 488.18, "text": "But it was on the table.", "end": 489.98}, {"start": 489.98, "text": "当时他在桌上。", "end": 491.78}, {"start": 491.78, "text": "你一听一个is就知道他还在桌上。", "end": 494.98}, {"start": 494.98, "text": "如果别人说was。", "end": 496.58}, {"start": 496.58, "text": "那就已经不在桌上了。", "end": 498.84}, {"start": 498.84, "text": "was可以理解就是is的过去状态。", "end": 502.44}, {"start": 502.44, "text": "It was on the table.", "end": 504.04}, {"start": 504.04, "text": "注意这个虚线。", "end": 505.04}, {"start": 505.04, "text": "It is on his head.", "end": 507.04}, {"start": 507.24, "text": "是否正在他头上。", "end": 508.64}, {"start": 508.64, "text": "是的。", "end": 509.44}, {"start": 509.44, "text": "所以it is on his head.", "end": 514.73}, {"start": 514.73, "text": "It was there.", "end": 516.33}, {"start": 516.33, "text": "Now it is here.", "end": 518.33}, {"start": 518.33, "text": "我们开始接触时态了。", "end": 520.13}, {"start": 520.13, "text": "好。", "end": 520.53}, {"start": 520.53, "text": "所以我们说这个课程良心在哪里。", "end": 523.13}, {"start": 523.13, "text": "他不断的帮你回顾总结。", "end": 526.33}, {"start": 526.33, "text": "不会把你丢在那里不管你。", "end": 527.73}, {"start": 527.73, "text": "让你去背。", "end": 528.73}, {"start": 528.73, "text": "That's wrong。", "end": 530.5}, {"start": 530.5, "text": "那好啦。", "end": 531.3}, {"start": 531.3, "text": "显然这个男人已经到达他的单位了。", "end": 534.5}, {"start": 534.5, "text": "准备把帽子脱下来了。", "end": 536.5}, {"start": 536.5, "text": "以前老外都是有戴帽子。", "end": 538.3}, {"start": 538.3, "text": "民国时期我国男人也很多会戴帽子。", "end": 541.3}, {"start": 541.3, "text": "所以这个不奇怪。", "end": 542.9}, {"start": 542.9, "text": "现在他进屋了。", "end": 544.1}, {"start": 544.1, "text": "He's going to.", "end": 545.5}, {"start": 545.5, "text": "He will.", "end": 546.5}, {"start": 546.5, "text": "我们刚刚学的。", "end": 547.3}, {"start": 547.3, "text": "他准备去做这个事。", "end": 549.34}, {"start": 549.34, "text": "He will take the hat put take.", "end": 556.54}, {"start": 556.54, "text": "He will take the hat off his head.", "end": 566.86}, {"start": 566.86, "text": "他的帽子。", "end": 567.86}, {"start": 567.86, "text": "男人的帽子。", "end": 569.26}, {"start": 569.26, "text": "He will take his hat off his head.", "end": 577.92}, {"start": 577.92, "text": "刚刚是put it on his head。", "end": 580.12}, {"start": 580.12, "text": "现在是will take it off his head。", "end": 582.52}, {"start": 582.52, "text": "对吧。", "end": 583.94}, {"start": 583.94, "text": "这里的will说明这个事还没发生。", "end": 588.32}, {"start": 588.32, "text": "还是他的意愿。", "end": 589.72}, {"start": 589.72, "text": "He is taking the hat, his hat off his head.", "end": 594.54}, {"start": 594.54, "text": "taking 是不是正在做持续状态。", "end": 597.74}, {"start": 597.74, "text": "所以是这样。", "end": 598.74}, {"start": 598.74, "text": "I am taking my hat off my head.", "end": 605.79}, {"start": 605.79, "text": "I will take my hat off my head.", "end": 608.19}, {"start": 608.19, "text": "I am taking my hat off my head.", "end": 613.82}, {"start": 613.82, "text": "He is taking 注意他的手正抓着帽子。", "end": 617.62}, {"start": 617.62, "text": "taking 注意英语的in指的是持续状态。", "end": 623.92}, {"start": 623.92, "text": "在这里指的是正在进行。", "end": 626.52}, {"start": 626.52, "text": "就是我们汉语说的。", "end": 628.12}, {"start": 628.12, "text": "正做着这个事。", "end": 633.0}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "His hat is in his hand.", "end": 640.49}, {"start": 640.49, "text": "是不是正在我的手里。", "end": 642.29}, {"start": 642.29, "text": "所以是is in my hand.", "end": 645.26}, {"start": 645.26, "text": "It was on his head.", "end": 647.06}, {"start": 647.06, "text": "本来在我头上。", "end": 648.46}, {"start": 648.46, "text": "所以the hat was on my head.", "end": 652.84}, {"start": 652.84, "text": "It is in my hand.", "end": 655.78}, {"start": 655.78, "text": "It was on my head.", "end": 657.98}, {"start": 657.98, "text": "It is in my hand.", "end": 660.31}, {"start": 660.31, "text": "His hat is in his hand.", "end": 664.14}, {"start": 664.14, "text": "It was on his head.", "end": 666.14}, {"start": 666.14, "text": "本来在头上。", "end": 667.34}, {"start": 667.34, "text": "It was on his head.", "end": 669.14}, {"start": 669.14, "text": "属于什么。", "end": 670.14}, {"start": 670.14, "text": "过去式。", "end": 671.14}, {"start": 671.14, "text": "He took his hat off.", "end": 673.82}, {"start": 673.82, "text": "他完成了这个动作。", "end": 675.42}, {"start": 675.42, "text": "所以不是take了。", "end": 676.82}, {"start": 676.82, "text": "如果我要去take是什么。", "end": 678.42}, {"start": 678.42, "text": "Will take。", "end": 679.62}, {"start": 679.62, "text": "如果我正在take是taking。", "end": 682.22}, {"start": 682.22, "text": "如果已经take了就是took。", "end": 685.14}, {"start": 685.14, "text": "He took his hat off.", "end": 686.74}, {"start": 686.74, "text": "I took my hat off.", "end": 689.23}, {"start": 689.23, "text": "The hat was on my head.", "end": 691.63}, {"start": 691.63, "text": "Now it's in my hand.", "end": 694.03}, {"start": 694.03, "text": "I took the hat off.", "end": 696.43}, {"start": 696.43, "text": "所以你看这个课程的量跟进阶。", "end": 700.19}, {"start": 700.19, "text": "这个语言的发展非常快。", "end": 702.79}, {"start": 702.79, "text": "我们从无到有已经发展成能讲完整事情的人了。", "end": 707.19}, {"start": 707.19, "text": "所以拖零机怎么拖。", "end": 709.29}, {"start": 709.29, "text": "你们现在深有感触。", "end": 711.09}, {"start": 711.09, "text": "当然记住。", "end": 712.09}, {"start": 712.09, "text": "目前时态你们是用了。", "end": 714.29}, {"start": 714.29, "text": "第一遍到第五遍。", "end": 716.69}, {"start": 716.69, "text": "你就能终身带走了。", "end": 718.69}, {"start": 718.69, "text": "所以记住不断的去运用。", "end": 720.89}, {"start": 720.89, "text": "我们在后续文章里也会不断的去运用。", "end": 723.69}, {"start": 723.69, "text": "Don't worry。", "end": 724.69}, {"start": 724.69, "text": "别担心。", "end": 725.69}, {"start": 725.69, "text": "这个图我们先放大看一下。", "end": 728.09}, {"start": 728.09, "text": "这里有一个人。", "end": 729.09}, {"start": 729.09, "text": "He是个男人。", "end": 730.49}, {"start": 730.49, "text": "我现在明白了。", "end": 731.49}, {"start": 731.49, "text": "这样的话像是一个男人。", "end": 733.69}, {"start": 733.69, "text": "他帽子戴