子早已拿走了。", "end": 1055.25}, {"start": 1055.25, "text": "有虚线了。", "end": 1056.25}, {"start": 1056.25, "text": "帽子也早已戴上了。", "end": 1058.51}, {"start": 1058.51, "text": "说明he跟帽子off the table这件事的关系是过去了。", "end": 1064.76}, {"start": 1064.76, "text": "He took his hat off the table。", "end": 1068.71}, {"start": 1068.71, "text": "Take的过去是take。", "end": 1070.51}, {"start": 1070.51, "text": "记住put on take off。", "end": 1074.24}, {"start": 1074.24, "text": "Take的过去是he took his hat off the table。", "end": 1078.04}, {"start": 1078.04, "text": "已经完成了。", "end": 1079.24}, {"start": 1079.24, "text": "不是will take也不是taking。", "end": 1081.44}, {"start": 1081.44, "text": "是took。", "end": 1082.64}, {"start": 1082.64, "text": "It什么on his head。", "end": 1085.24}, {"start": 1085.24, "text": "帽子在他头上吗?", "end": 1086.44}, {"start": 1086.44, "text": "Is it on his head?", "end": 1087.84}, {"start": 1087.84, "text": "Yes.", "end": 1088.84}, {"start": 1088.84, "text": "It is on his head。", "end": 1090.64}, {"start": 1090.64, "text": "如果说it什么on the table。", "end": 1093.96}, {"start": 1093.96, "text": "那应该说什么?", "end": 1095.69}, {"start": 1095.69, "text": "跟桌子的关系是什么?", "end": 1097.69}, {"start": 1097.69, "text": "It was on the table。", "end": 1100.09}, {"start": 1100.09, "text": "Good.", "end": 1101.09}, {"start": 1101.09, "text": "It is on his head.", "end": 1102.49}, {"start": 1102.49, "text": "He took his hat off the table。", "end": 1105.49}, {"start": 1105.49, "text": "这个就是一个很明确的过去是。", "end": 1107.89}, {"start": 1107.89, "text": "来我们做个确认。", "end": 1109.49}, {"start": 1109.49, "text": "也稍微了解一下拼写。", "end": 1111.89}, {"start": 1111.89, "text": "He took。", "end": 1112.89}, {"start": 1112.89, "text": "注意took。", "end": 1115.69}, {"start": 1115.69, "text": "所以英语是talk。", "end": 1117.89}, {"start": 1117.89, "text": "talk就不要接近英国人原本的发音。", "end": 1121.75}, {"start": 1121.75, "text": "现代人都说took。", "end": 1123.95}, {"start": 1123.95, "text": "比较模糊一点。", "end": 1125.35}, {"start": 1125.35, "text": "It is on his head。", "end": 1127.15}, {"start": 1127.15, "text": "注意is和was的拼写。", "end": 1128.95}, {"start": 1128.95, "text": "is is和was was。", "end": 1134.35}, {"start": 1134.35, "text": "好。", "end": 1134.95}, {"start": 1135.38, "text": "如果这几题你都做对。", "end": 1136.98}, {"start": 1136.98, "text": "你对基本的时态已经很有感觉了。", "end": 1139.38}, {"start": 1139.38, "text": "英语后续的时态问题", "end": 1141.18}, {"start": 1141.18, "text": "都是在这个基础上略有调整。", "end": 1144.38}, {"start": 1144.38, "text": "这个我们今天不去专门去深究。", "end": 1146.78}, {"start": 1146.78, "text": "走到这一步。", "end": 1147.78}, {"start": 1147.78, "text": "我们就认到这一步就好了。", "end": 1149.58}, {"start": 1149.58, "text": "那practice makes perfect。", "end": 1152.99}, {"start": 1152.99, "text": "Eric最爱让你们练习了。", "end": 1154.99}, {"start": 1154.99, "text": "实战练习。", "end": 1155.99}, {"start": 1155.99, "text": "所以我们今天还是以情境为导向。", "end": 1158.99}, {"start": 1158.99, "text": "去做这三个实境的练习。", "end": 1162.53}, {"start": 1162.53, "text": "Put on take off coat。", "end": 1165.13}, {"start": 1165.13, "text": "Put on take off和一个coat。", "end": 1167.73}, {"start": 1167.73, "text": "然后我们今天不说帽子了。", "end": 1169.33}, {"start": 1169.33, "text": "我们说外套。", "end": 1170.93}, {"start": 1170.93, "text": "好。", "end": 1171.53}, {"start": 1171.53, "text": "我们先看情境一。", "end": 1173.33}, {"start": 1173.33, "text": "这个人在干嘛。", "end": 1174.53}, {"start": 1174.53, "text": "他正在穿。", "end": 1176.42}, {"start": 1176.42, "text": "那我们要怎么说。", "end": 1178.05}, {"start": 1178.05, "text": "我们默认他是个男性。", "end": 1179.65}, {"start": 1179.65, "text": "光头然后直直的。", "end": 1181.45}, {"start": 1181.45, "text": "应该是个男人。", "end": 1183.62}, {"start": 1183.62, "text": "男人怎么说he还是she。", "end": 1186.18}, {"start": 1186.18, "text": "He is putting on his coat。", "end": 1193.88}, {"start": 1193.88, "text": "正在穿。", "end": 1195.08}, {"start": 1195.08, "text": "这里他显然正在进行中。", "end": 1197.08}, {"start": 1197.08, "text": "所以是什么。", "end": 1198.08}, {"start": 1198.08, "text": "现在是进行式。", "end": 1200.08}, {"start": 1200.08, "text": "He is putting on。", "end": 1201.08}, {"start": 1201.08, "text": "这里他穿好了吗?", "end": 1202.48}, {"start": 1202.48, "text": "他已经走在外面了。", "end": 1203.68}, {"start": 1203.68, "text": "如果没穿好。", "end": 1204.88}, {"start": 1204.88, "text": "He'll get cold.", "end": 1206.91}, {"start": 1206.91, "text": "他显然很淡然。", "end": 1208.11}, {"start": 1208.11, "text": "说明穿得好好的。", "end": 1210.07}, {"start": 1210.07, "text": "He put on his coat。", "end": 1213.12}, {"start": 1213.12, "text": "已经不是putting on了。", "end": 1214.72}, {"start": 1214.72, "text": "很多学生爱在这种细节上犯错。", "end": 1217.72}, {"start": 1217.72, "text": "分不清put跟putting。", "end": 1220.12}, {"start": 1220.12, "text": "他早已穿好了。", "end": 1221.52}, {"start": 1221.52, "text": "这事过去了。", "end": 1222.92}, {"start": 1222.92, "text": "He put on his coat。", "end": 1224.12}, {"start": 1224.12, "text": "如果再进一步说就是什么。", "end": 1226.32}, {"start": 1226.32, "text": "He put on his coat at home。", "end": 1228.12}, {"start": 1228.12, "text": "在家就穿了。", "end": 1229.32}, {"start": 1229.32, "text": "当然你可以对coat的状态做一个确认。", "end": 1232.52}, {"start": 1232.52, "text": "It is on his body。", "end": 1236.35}, {"start": 1236.35, "text": "他的身体。", "end": 1237.35}, {"start": 1237.35, "text": "His body。", "end": 1238.35}, {"start": 1238.35, "text": "刚刚帽子是his head。", "end": 1239.95}, {"start": 1239.95, "text": "现在是his body。", "end": 1242.64}, {"start": 1242.64, "text": "The coat.", "end": 1243.64}, {"start": 1243.64, "text": "It is on his body。", "end": 1246.74}, {"start": 1246.74, "text": "这是coat现在的状态。", "end": 1248.54}, {"start": 1248.54, "text": "This is a TV.", "end": 1249.94}, {"start": 1249.94, "text": "This is a sofa couch.", "end": 1251.74}, {"start": 1251.74, "text": "He is sitting on the sofa。", "end": 1253.74}, {"start": 1253.74, "text": "注意sitting。", "end": 1254.54}, {"start": 1254.54, "text": "正在做。", "end": 1255.74}, {"start": 1255.74, "text": "这时候他有穿coat吗?", "end": 1257.34}, {"start": 1257.34, "text": "Is the coat on him?", "end": 1260.34}, {"start": 1260.34, "text": "No。", "end": 1260.94}, {"start": 1261.53, "text": "这时候已经没有了。", "end": 1263.13}, {"start": 1263.13, "text": "所以我们要说什么。", "end": 1264.73}, {"start": 1264.73, "text": "He took off.", "end": 1266.93}, {"start": 1266.93, "text": "Take off.", "end": 1268.33}, {"start": 1268.33, "text": "Took off.", "end": 1269.73}, {"start": 1269.73, "text": "He took off his coat。", "end": 1271.53}, {"start": 1271.53, "text": "为什么是took off?", "end": 1272.73}, {"start": 1272.73, "text": "不是taking off。", "end": 1273.93}, {"start": 1273.93, "text": "或者will take off。", "end": 1275.76}, {"start": 1275.76, "text": "显然不是will take。", "end": 1277.36}, {"start": 1277.36, "text": "早就做完这件事了。", "end": 1278.96}, {"start": 1278.96, "text": "也不是taking。", "end": 1280.16}, {"start": 1280.16, "text": "现在没有正在做。", "end": 1281.76}, {"start": 1281.76, "text": "是早已脱掉了。", "end": 1283.96}, {"start": 1283.96, "text": "He took off his coat.", "end": 1285.76}, {"start": 1285.76, "text": "I don't know where the coat is。", "end": 1287.16}, {"start": 1287.16, "text": "我们不知道coat去哪了。", "end": 1289.61}, {"start": 1289.61, "text": "但是我们可以说it。", "end": 1292.61}, {"start": 1292.61, "text": "我说的it是coat on the coat。", "end": 1295.5}, {"start": 1295.5, "text": "It was on his body。", "end": 1298.5}, {"start": 1298.5, "text": "The coat was on his body。", "end": 1301.1}, {"start": 1301.1, "text": "什么。", "end": 1301.7}, {"start": 1301.7, "text": "coat本来在他身上。", "end": 1304.0}, {"start": 1304.0, "text": "It was on his body。", "end": 1305.8}, {"start": 1305.8, "text": "Is the coat on his body?", "end": 1307.6}, {"start": 1307.6, "text": "No。", "end": 1308.4}, {"start": 1308.4, "text": "It was on his body。", "end": 1310.8}, {"start": 1310.8, "text": "He took off the coat。", "end": 1314.86}, {"start": 1314.86, "text": "反复摸一下情境。", "end": 1316.86}, {"start": 1316.86, "text": "是不是对时态的感觉更强了。", "end": 1319.06}, {"start": 1319.06, "text": "对put和take这两个字。", "end": 1321.26}, {"start": 1321.26, "text": "take跟put。", "end": 1322.66}, {"start": 1322.66, "text": "你也有进一步的感触。", "end": 1324.86}, {"start": 1324.86, "text": "截止到这里。", "end": 1325.66}, {"start": 1325.66, "text": "这是你们第二次接触常规时态跟take和put。", "end": 1330.04}, {"start": 1330.04, "text": "记住五遍的法则。", "end": 1332.23}, {"start": 1332.23, "text": "不要急于现在。", "end": 1333.43}, {"start": 1333.43, "text": "以后我们还会回顾。", "end": 1335.23}, {"start": 1335.23, "text": "为了照顾大家的拼写。", "end": 1337.43}, {"start": 1337.43, "text": "我们最后看一遍做个确认。", "end": 1339.23}, {"start": 1339.23, "text": "The man is putting on his coat。", "end": 1342.93}, {"start": 1342.93, "text": "正在穿。", "end": 1344.33}, {"start": 1344.33, "text": "Is putting 挺 硬 硬 硬 on his coat。", "end": 1348.33}, {"start": 1348.33, "text": "足以戒词。", "end": 1349.53}, {"start": 1349.53, "text": "英语不叫戒词叫方位词。", "end": 1352.53}, {"start": 1352.53, "text": "putting on强调是什么。", "end": 1354.33}, {"start": 1354.33, "text": "你put这个动作的方向或者方位。", "end": 1357.53}, {"start": 1357.53, "text": "on his body。", "end": 1360.13}, {"start": 1360.13, "text": "在什么上面。", "end": 1361.33}, {"start": 1361.33, "text": "on his body。", "end": 1362.93}, {"start": 1362.93, "text": "He is putting on his coat.", "end": 1365.26}, {"start": 1365.26, "text": "He puts on his coat。", "end": 1368.26}, {"start": 1368.26, "text": "这里说puts on。", "end": 1370.05}, {"start": 1370.05, "text": "这是常态。", "end": 1371.45}, {"start": 1371.45, "text": "我不在这里展开。", "end": 1372.85}, {"start": 1372.85, "text": "你们完全可以说he put on his coat。", "end": 1375.45}, {"start": 1375.45, "text": "他已经穿好了。", "end": 1377.08}, {"start": 1377.08, "text": "以及最后的he took off his coat。", "end": 1380.08}, {"start": 1380.08, "text": "过去是he took off。", "end": 1382.56}, {"start": 1382.56, "text": "这里这个puts。", "end": 1383.96}, {"start": 1383.96, "text": "我们以后会接触到。", "end": 1385.56}, {"start": 1385.56, "text": "有人说不是已经put on his coat了吗?", "end": 1389.16}, {"start": 1389.16, "text": "已经穿好了吗?", "end": 1390.36}, {"start": 1390.36, "text": "为什么有个puts on his coat。", "end": 1392.59}, {"start": 1392.59, "text": "我以后会讲。", "end": 1393.59}, {"start": 1393.59, "text": "注意这个s。", "end": 1394.79}, {"start": 1394.79, "text": "是一个复述的概念。", "end": 1396.39}, {"start": 1396.39, "text": "我们下次会接触。", "end": 1397.99}, {"start": 1397.99, "text": "这次让你们先窥视一下。", "end": 1401.39}, {"start": 1401.39, "text": "看一眼。", "end": 1403.38}, {"start": 1403.38, "text": "截止到这里。", "end": 1405.0}, {"start": 1405.0, "text": "You're good。", "end": 1406.0}, {"start": 1406.0, "text": "我们完成了Lesson 4。", "end": 1408.0}, {"start": 1408.0, "text": "I hope you enjoyed.", "end": 1409.6}, {"start": 1409.6, "text": "I will see you again in Lesson 5。", "end": 1412.62}]}